# 25 October 2026 : ZenRay Meshes, deterministic shape generator (guide curves and topology templates), no AI.
# EN: every family of catalog.json is a definition here; index n -> a point of the family's parameter box through a
# Halton sequence (one prime per parameter), so n = 0, 1, 2 ... enumerates an unbounded set of valid shapes and the same
# n always gives the same shape. Output: named 3D guide curves (and quads for SubD templates) as JSON, plus contact
# sheets. FR : chaque famille est une définition ; l'index n donne toujours la même forme valide, sans fin.
# Usage: python ShapeGen.py sheet <family|all> [start=0] [count=64]
#        python ShapeGen.py export <family> <n> <out.json>
